WEBVTT

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.970
<i>I am the Knight of the Black Swan, Odile.</i>

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.320
<i>I'm just your average girl.</i>

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.330
<i>I'm a bit clumsy and a ditz,</i>

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.370
<i>but I enjoy my life every day with my father.</i>

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.560
I'm off!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.210
<i>Oh, no! I'm going to be late!</i>

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.060
<i>But one day...</i>

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.930
I'm home!

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.890
<b>To Odile</b>

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:41.230
<i>My father left me a single letter, 
and then disappeared!</i>

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:42.380
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.850
<b>Oh, no!!</b>

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:50.820
<b>Destroy the Stella Prisms 
From your dad</b>

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:46.070
<i>And he told me to collect and destroy</i>

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:50.820
<i>all the Stella Prisms that mess with 
the natural order of the world.</i>

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.020
<i>I didn't get what was going on at all!</i>

00:00:55.360 --> 00:01:00.830
<i>But I have no choice if I want 
to find my father, right?</i>

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:02.620
<i>And so...</i>

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.850
<i>Hello, everyone watching this video!</i>

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>I'm the Knight of the Black Swan, Odile.</i>

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:15.490
<i>Anyway, I was thinking of taking 
the Stella Prism that's in your base</i>

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.170
<i>three days from now, at midnight.</i>

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:20.440
<i>See you then.</i>

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.620
<i>Also...</i>

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.060
<i>Huh? What?</i>

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:24.160
<i>The battery's dying?</i>

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:25.030
<i>Really?</i>

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:26.290
<i>Hold on! Wait, wait, wait!</i>

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:27.650
<i>Not now!</i>

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.250
<i>Okay, wait just a second! Wait!</i>

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.310
<i>Your base—</i>

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:35.990
Yep, yep.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:14.620
So anyway, that file was left 
on my desk in the staff room.

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:14.540
<b>Arrived! The Lone Knight</b>

00:03:14.620 --> 00:03:16.270
So that's what's going on.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.300
I was wondering why you had that...

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:20.100
That set was really impressive.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.550
I wonder if she made it all by hand.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:24.890
I wanted to see the end.

00:03:24.890 --> 00:03:27.510
I'm glad we all feel the same way.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:31.820
She said she's going to take our 
Stella Prism three days from now...

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:36.770
But we won't be able to take out 
any O'bli without our Stella Prism!

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:40.440
So we have to stop her.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.980
Stop her...

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:44.210
We've managed to get away 
all this time, but...

00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:46.910
Yeah, she's really strong.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:50.120
Yeah, if she came at us with all she's got,

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:53.210
she might be able to win, 
even with all of us against her.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:04:00.900
I wonder if Biscuit Sirius would be able 
to handle her, if all of them went at her.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:03.130
Strength isn't the only thing on her side.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.100
If they get distracted by 
the weird way she talks,

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.850
I don't know how they'll fare.

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.180
Anyway, we'll all just have to stop her.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:14.530
Luckily, we still have three days, 
so let's come up with a plan by then.

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:15.690
Oh, sorry!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:19.690
Actually, this video was put 
on my desk three days ago.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.980
I completely forgot.

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:22.700
Tee-hee.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:31.240
Tonight?!

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:40.330
Why of all times...

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:43.510
<i>Make sure you take it out and 
come back as fast as you can.</i>

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:48.160
Come on, hit already!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:49.220
<i>It's almost midnight!</i>

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:54.480
Altair Torte and us are the only ones 
that can guard Eterno tonight.

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.610
I know that already!

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.820
Darn it, this always happens...

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.820
It's coming directly into my head.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:19.080
How are we supposed to handle this?

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.340
<i>Ako, are you ready?</i>

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:25.300
Leave it to me!

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:28.390
I'm going to take it out with this one shot!

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:51.120
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.640
<i>Hang in there!</i>

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:58.120
Keep it down! It's the middle of the night!

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:03.340
Don't you realize you're 
bothering the neighbors?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:07.740
I have something really, really 
important to do tonight!

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.920
So give it up already! You got that?!

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:08.800
Odile?

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.600
She saved us, I guess?

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:14.570
Um...

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:15.310
Huh?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.450
What? You were here?

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:21.900
You were here this whole time?!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.090
Um, thank you.

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.640
You really helped us out.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:27.300
What?

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.250
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.620
I wasn't trying to save you!

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:34.850
The O'bli was really loud 
and was in the way, so...

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:35.730
<i>Hey, are you okay?</i>

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:36.790
<i>What happened?</i>

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:39.040
Odile appeared over here.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:41.170
<i>What? What do you mean?</i>

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.530
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:43.790
Yeah, probably.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.020
By the way, what time is it?

00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:49.810
Uh, it's past midnight.

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:50.300
For real?!

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.100
What should I do?!

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:53.350
I promised, too.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:55.860
I know.

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:57.770
I know you promised, but...

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:58.780
Oh...

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:04.070
Um, we're going back to Eterno, so...

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.420
You want to come with us?

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:08.590
Shut up!

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:10.280
This isn't awkward or anything!

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.990
<i>Hey, answer me! What's going on?</i>

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.300
You can disband the defense team.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:19.040
<i>Huh?</i>

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:27.430
I can't...

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:28.670
I just can't...

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:32.400
I shouldn't have sent that video.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.180
I can't do this.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:41.690
Sachiko

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:41.690
It doesn't look like they're misusing 
their Stella Prism at all.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:44.930
But I can't back out now...

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:46.520
What should I do?!

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.860
Huh?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.970
Is someone in there?

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:55.480
Was I imagining it?

00:07:57.400 --> 00:08:00.370
That was one of the three Origami sisters.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:07.130
So in the end, Odile saved you?

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:10.980
Yeah, and now we don't know
when she's coming next.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:13.630
But she might not be that 
bad of a person, after all.

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:16.900
I really like her style. It's cool.

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:18.580
I wanna do that, too.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.560
What? Really?

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:23.570
Yeah, you hide who you are 
and fight for your mission.

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:25.190
Just like a real hero!

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:27.870
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:29.940
Yep, sounds good.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:31.620
Mission...

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:34.140
If what she said in that video was true,

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:36.110
then I'd like to talk to her, but...

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.590
The Knight of the Black Swan, Odile...

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:40.740
I wonder just who she is.

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:44.910
But why did she send that weird video?

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:45.960
She doesn't want to do it.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:48.640
What do you mean?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.770
There's a reason why she has to,

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:52.550
but she doesn't want to.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.750
She wants us to realize that.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.470
That's what I felt.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.850
From that video?

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:01.680
She isn't even trying to hide 
that she's a student here.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:03.750
She's messing around

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:07.190
and using a mask because she 
can't say how she really feels.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:10.640
I'm sure she's just bad 
with social situations

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:13.320
and normally hides, without standing out.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:14.800
Oh...

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.140
Makes sense.

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.030
You're not good with people either, huh?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.620
Was there something you 
were able to relate to?

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:26.050
She's a student at our school?!

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:27.600
Odile is?

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:29.740
She was wearing a uniform 
in the video, right?

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:32.380
Plus, it was left on a teacher's desk.

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.430
Of course!

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:37.880
In any event, it's not a good idea for 
us to fight her head-on right now.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:41.040
We should figure out who she 
really is before she comes again,

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.680
and then if we talk things out,
everything might be okay.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.980
No, we have to.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:55.020
So after Maricchi's analysis and 
Akocchi and the others' research,

00:09:55.020 --> 00:10:00.780
the Knight of the Black Swan, Odile, 
has to be Tanaka Sachiko-san from our class.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.490
Huh?

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.510
The same class as Yuumi and the others?

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:06.040
Oh, well, that makes things easy.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.670
Well, maybe not, actually.

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:15.840
We forgot that she was in our class, too.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.800
It's more than just not having much presence.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:22.430
She leaves immediately after class is over.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:27.060
And then, suddenly, she's back just 
barely before the next class begins.

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:28.990
She doesn't get involved with anyone,

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:30.820
and doesn't catch anyone's attention.

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:33.360
It's amazing. She disappears in an instant.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.280
So, as you can tell,
even if we know who she is,

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.590
we won't be able to talk to her.

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:41.190
She's that good at hiding her presence.

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:46.210
Plus, she has the agility to move instantly and 
an attitude that makes her avoid everyone.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:48.210
She's someone special.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.380
Sheesh, what do we do about this?

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:57.680
I can't...

00:10:57.680 --> 00:11:01.100
They're looking for me,

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:03.850
but I'm so scared that I end up running away.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:07.100
Found you! I knew there was someone here!

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:09.430
You knew?

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:11.860
You're always crying in here, right?

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:13.220
I got curious.

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:15.440
Oh, I'm Origami Hina.

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.770
Nice to meet you.

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:25.450
Origami Hina-chan?

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:27.980
That's the middle sister, right?

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:29.450
The cheerful one?

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:33.210
She transferred into the first-year 
class with Akara-san, right?

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:34.470
Yes.

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:37.010
According to my thorough interviews,

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:42.390
Hina-san has a chance of coming 
in contact with Tanaka Sachiko-san.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.660
Sato-chin, you're amazing!

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:49.680
I was the one who did all 
those interviews, though.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:53.400
And right after I accidentally found 
her hiding place. It was like fate.

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:56.530
Wow, that's an unexpected connection.

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:59.150
So, did you get her to help?

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:02.570
Yup! She couldn't turn down a request from me.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.500
I see...

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.030
I didn't think Sacchan would be...

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.400
Okay, fine.

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:11.000
Just leave it to me.

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.620
I want some katsudon if it goes well!

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:16.420
That's what happened.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:18.980
Should she really take it that lightly?

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.550
Hina-chan seems like she'd 
be good at communicating.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:24.190
We'll just have to put our faith

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:25.920
in the power of katsudon.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:29.930
I see...

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.640
Things must be pretty tough for you.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:37.400
Well, um... Don't, um, tell anyone...

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:38.480
Yeah.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:40.150
It's fine, it's fine.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.820
I'll just gloss over this part.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:47.410
But it's good that you have a goal.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:51.920
I mean, we're all haphazard at best.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:53.710
We were forced to do all that stuff.

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:55.960
We have no clue what'll happen to us next.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:03.090
I mean, I have Onee and Koori,

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:06.360
but you've been fighting by yourself 
this whole time, right?

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.300
That's amazing.

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.180
You've been working hard.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.320
Um...

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:21.000
That's the first time someone's 
said anything like that to me.

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.150
I...

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.950
I think I'm going to support you instead.

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:35.080
There's something you have 
to do no matter what, right?

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:37.750
Yes.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:43.860
Oh, well... I guess I'll have to 
give up on that katsudon.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.400
It's almost midnight.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:55.680
Almost time.

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:08.500
I wonder if Phantom Thief 
Odile will really show up.

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.660
I'm totally coming tonight, 
so wait for me. 
Phantom Thief Odile

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:15.290
Hina-chin said that Sacchin and Odi-chin 
have nothing to do with each other, too.

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:17.930
Oh, that's probably a lie.

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:18.520
Huh?

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:22.540
They probably have a reason 
to hide the truth.

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:26.300
I guess we'll just have to ask her directly.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.280
According to Sensei,

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:32.300
Odile can travel to the boundary on her own.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:36.520
So that means she can come 
to Eterno on her own, right?

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.020
It's time.

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:44.900
Odile!

00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:47.610
When did you get here?!

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:52.330
U-Um...

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.270
Maybe she really doesn't intend to talk.

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:59.960
Boss, don't!

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:02.960
Oh?

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.340
Let's change locations.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:19.100
Hey...

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:19.810
Huh?

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.600
Why did you send that notice?

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:25.860
Huh? If I didn't tell you, I'd be stealing.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.040
It's still stealing, even if you did tell us!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:28.980
No way!

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:29.820
Seriously?!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.750
I thought it wouldn't count as stealing 
if I announced it in advance!

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.530
It's the same either way.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.210
I see...

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:41.890
Well, I snuck in on my own a while ago.

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:48.000
I totally felt like a robber, 
so I made that video...

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:51.380
I see... So there was no point.

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:53.760
You snuck in, huh?

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.430
I didn't notice at all.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:58.620
You could have stolen it 
anytime you wanted, then?

00:16:01.420 --> 00:16:04.010
Hey, you're Tanaka Sachiko-san, right?

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:05.610
Huh? Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.050
Of course not!

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:12.260
I'm totally not a beautiful young girl,
like Tanaka Sachiko is!

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:14.020
It really is her, then...

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:14.740
Yeah.

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.160
You know, you guys...

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:20.290
What?

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:22.770
You can't beat me anyway, right?

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:26.520
So how about you just hand 
the Stella Prism over to me?

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:27.380
How about it?

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.670
We can't do that.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.520
I see.

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.300
Yeah, I guess not.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:35.050
But we might be able to help you.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:39.220
You're searching for your father, 
like that video said, right?

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:43.480
You told us in a roundabout way, right?

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:47.810
If your father ordered you to 
get rid of the Stella Prisms,

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:51.600
it must have something 
to do with Fifth Force.

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:52.650
Yeah!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.730
Let's search for him together!

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:57.660
That won't work.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:58.780
Huh?

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:03.360
There's no point if I can't 
do it with my own power!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.420
Io-chin!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:11.380
Watch out!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:22.930
This is a fight to find my true self.

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.420
Huh?

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.150
Don't fall for something so simple, Mana!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.160
Wh-What?

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:56.930
The five of us can't do anything against her...

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.480
Oh, no.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:10.110
I have to get reinforcements...

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:11.270
Don't move.

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:14.300
Origami Hina-san...

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:18.070
Are you really against us?

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.590
Don't hate me for this.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:22.920
You really helped Onee out,

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:25.450
but this is something different.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:28.710
Are you serious?

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:33.460
Everyone was happy to finally 
be able to get to know you.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.980
I know that, but...

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:41.500
Sacchan doesn't even know herself,

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:44.600
and she's been trying so hard 
on her own this whole time.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.340
A certain girl helped me figure out...

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:52.230
what I need to do now!

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:57.440
So who cares if I help a girl out?

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:07.620
Sacchan acts like that, but she's nice, 
a straight shooter, and trying her hardest.

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:10.570
Now I can, with everyone...

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:33.770
She did that on purpose?

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.010
Whatever!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:41.560
I might have lost today,

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.250
but I can take your Stella Prism at any time!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.240
So I'll save you for later!

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:51.540
<i>The next time we meet will be after 
I get rid of all the other Stella Prisms!</i>

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:53.220
Remember that!

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.120
Later!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.420
We settled it?

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:03.800
She doesn't seem like a bad person at all.

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:06.430
Yeah.

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:10.600
If she'll tell us her story someday...

00:20:11.260 --> 00:20:13.450
We might be able to understand each other.

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:20.030
So, can you tell me what's going on?

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:23.140
Sorry, I can't do that.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:25.530
Ask Sacchan herself sometime.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:26.900
See you!

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.090
It might be hard to go straight to it,

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.840
but just as much as you can, 
a little at a time, right?

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:44.840
I think we were able to get closer to her...

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.640
We couldn't even talk to her, though.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:50.310
Hey! Sacchin's here!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:51.700
Why?!

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:54.190
Wh-What is it?

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:57.120
It's like she's a different person.

00:20:57.120 --> 00:21:01.190
Then I guess we can deal with her here?

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:02.480
Yeah.

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:08.700
I wonder who the Knight of the 
Black Swan, Odile, really was!

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:16.920
Hey, Sacchin, let's go to 
an arcade after school.

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.350
We can invite Hina-chin.

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:20.880
H-Huh?

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.130
Okay, it's a promise.

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:24.950
Right...

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:34.690
The real world is starting to show distortions 
due to the Stella Prisms, I see.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:40.630
The scientist who invented 
the Prisms is still missing,

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:42.780
so there's no one who can control them.

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:49.210
Looks like something interesting 
is about to happen.

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
<b>Hair-raising! Unidentified Creature 
Spotted in the Snowy Mountains</b>

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:40.940
"Hair-raising! Unidentified Creature 
Spotted in the Snowy Mountains."
